  <para style="toc2">Filibai</para>
  <para style="toc1">Foloea Geleso Sosogo Filibai Nefolalebe Amolima, Beba Dëdëla Ïasi</para>
  <para style="mt">Foloea Geleso Sosogo Filibai Nefolalebe Amolima, Beba Dëdëla Ïasi</para>
  <para style="rem">13 Nofember 2016gi Hamagalea Ginidolea dëdëi.</para>
  <para style="rem">16 Nofember 2016gi dëdëla wagai.</para>
  <para style="rem">12 Jun 2018 printing copy for Hamaga to make corrections on</para>
  <para style="rem">20 Februarigi Hamaga Dulubalea hamogi gaso,</para>
  <para style="rem">5 Macygi Ginidoea hamogila agui.</para>
  <para style="rem">JG starts exegesis 17 Mar 23 but was primarily involved in transition and travel to PNG in following weeks. Resuming exegesis 22 May 23 after team heads back to Huya following review of Gal/Eph.</para>
  <para style="rem">JG finishes exegesis 14 Jun 23.</para>
  <para style="rem">Begin team review 2 Aug 23.</para>
  <para style="rem">27 Feb 24 received village testing changes passed by Duluba to Andy Grosh :-). reviewed changes and need to review many of them with the team.</para>
  <para style="rem">5 Nov 24 Reviewed village testing with team: Duluba Ibo, Hamaga Sabaya, Awi Heöle, Gosäea Säwa</para>
  <para style="rem">Begin consultant check with Duncan Kasokason 22 Jan 26 in Huya, finish 23 Jan. UNSs - Heose Galïma, Sifilö Welesu, Maliba Gialï, Digawa Osei, Ädulu Gaiago.</para>
  <para style="rem">Primary exegetical resources systematically used: Translator's Notes and Display, Translator's Handbook, Exegetical Helps on Philippians, and An Exegetical Summary of Philippians, all in TW Logos and using simplified layout in PT.</para>
  <para style="imt">Ado Dëdëi Dibe Amoïe Neala Olelo Oboba</para>
  <para style="ip">Folo e duhulu dëgëla mi gäwila degabo awäla Yulobo besela galalahilä, Masedonia Bolobinisiïe Filibai gaamugi, Ado Mala Hedabi säla olelemolö asi. Abosolo 16.8-15 bimalo. Oböla, hobeala ilia e Filibai gaamugi ami galabaia negei. Foloea Geleso sosogo Filibai nefolalo amolima beba gowe dëdëla ï amoda, eda galabaia mosöa nea, dëdëla ï. Foloea yöla nea, dëdëla ï amoïe mida, Godeïe ado mala dofä dibe amo gadola made, säla olelelo dolö odoa nefolalo amolia, Geleso sosogo Filibai nefolalo amolile asigi gagaolasila, säla olelesa neala säi amo nabalahilä, ea mala amo hamogimolöïe, beba we dëdëla ï. Yöla nelo gasoda, beba we dëdëla ï amea, Folo hï e Yesu Gelesoma asigi fodola namolöge, obeägïmolöge, beagolei amoïe ulufala olei dialea.</para>
  <para style="ip">Dafidi Folo e galabaia made negela nebegi, Geleso sosogo Filibai nefolalo amolia, Folo e gumusui nebegi, ugila negela nelebo odoa ïasi amoïe nesegela säla dëdëla ï. Amase elöda, ea ilile asigi neala gelolasimolö hamei. Mida, Folo e galabaia negei amogi, ilia asiala säosäola yöloeaïe.</para>
  <para style="ip">Udia dolö Gelesoma dilahilä, namolö gähe gaula aligilo amoïe mida, Yu udia dolö ilile yaua mäuïe mala hamosebe amea made, Yesu Gelesoma asigi afädë negesebe amea, namolö gähe gaula aligilomelëla säi. Foloea Geleso sosogo dilia gugusäla bimäia hamola made, dihili dili nagadaialahilä, asigi Yesu Gelesoea negei amo gadola negesa namolö dialeala säi. Geleso hïda, e dafidilo neala helësëlahilä, ea hï helësëse amo gadola bëgëla made hamoi. Eada hï e nagadaialahilä, Godea ema hamoi ï amo gadola hamosa nelo. Gelesoma dila nefolalebe amolima, Godea obeägïloge daluloge asigigi ïlo neebe amoïe dëdëi. Beba gogida, Yesuïe bëgëla aulo amolia obeägïmolöge, aeala hame negela namolöge, dilahilä afädëfalï namolöge, aso maadela, gelola namolöge, amolida sulubadela dilile dialeamelëla säla dëdëla negei dialea.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hä, beba goweada, Foloea Geleso sosogo Filibai nefolalo amoli edefademalä boba hamoi nelo amo ulufai dialea.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1" />
  <para style="ms">Filibai ilia Folobalä hedabola sosogo hamosebegi, Foloea obeägï</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="PHP 1-4">Filibai 1–4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1" />Folo Dimodi alïa, Geleso Yesuïe hamoi hamolasilo nea, Filibai gaamugi Godeïe udia dolö Geleso Yesuma dila nefolalebela dilimage, sigi aligilomage, digonomage, dili sulubadelama beba gowe dëdëla ïasisago. <verse eid="PHP 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2" />Nilïle Naado Godeage, Dafidilo Geloi Yesu Gelesoeage, dilima ugila negelasilole, neala dalulasilole, ïmäia hamesa neawe.<verse eid="PHP 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Foloea Godema nesegei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3" />Na dili helësëla, nïe Godema nesegesamu aligilomelë. <verse eid="PHP 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4" />Na dili sulubadela helësëla Godema adose amo sulubadelagida, obeägïsa nea, ëdëgësamu aligilomelë. <verse eid="PHP 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5" />Obeägïse amoïe mida, dafidi mi gäwia amila maaha nea, walioge nilïa ado mala säla ïmäia, dilia nilïbalä sosogo hamosamu neebe gogi. <verse eid="PHP 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6" />Hamoi hedabi Godea dilima mi gäwila hamoi amoda, hamosamu nea, dofä Geleso Yesuïe segeyo besela galasolo amo gala, hamola wagamolö gabula helësësa neamelë. <verse eid="PHP 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7" />Na dili sulubadela bobasëlahilä, helësësamu aligilo amoda, hedabi mogola hamosa neawe. Mida, dili nïe bobafalï neamelë. Ne nafodola galabaia nea galëge, odoaea Ado Mala Hedabi amoïe mi nabasegi, na säla obëgëla, Ado Mala Hedabi gelolasila säla ïaha aligimolö galëge, gamelä, dili sulubadela nebalä sosogo hamosegi, Godeïe ugila negeloea, nilï ugila negei neebe wemelë. <verse eid="PHP 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8" />Geleso Yesuïe bobasëlogila na dili sulubadela bimolöila nïe iso asigigi edefademalä hamesa neebe amoda, Godea dawamelë.<verse eid="PHP 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9" />Na Godema adosa neebe amoda gomalä. Dawa yafiege, dilile iso asigigi falagasela helësëlo amo sulubadelage besela galala, odoa boba hamolo amo dilile isogi dofä bäula edemäia, na dilile Godema adosa aligilomelë. <verse eid="PHP 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10" />Gelesoïe segeyo besela galasolo amo gala, dilima nigime baaige, asiai afädëge maade namolöïe, dilia mala sulubadela mogelahilä, mala hedabifalï amo memelemäiage, <verse eid="PHP 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11" />amase, Yesu Gelesomadila mala mogoi hamoloïe gägä negelo amo dilima nobamäiage, amala adosa aligilo. Gode hïdo elöi neebela säla, ïe ëi gauia adogomäiaïe sälo.<verse eid="PHP 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folo e galabaia negei ameada, ado mala daidola edelasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12" />Amaimo, nïe nedoo nalifila dili-e, ado gowe helësëmäia hamesamelë. Nema hamoi ameada, Ado Mala Hedabi amoda made gai. Daidola edesamelë. <verse eid="PHP 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13" />Amala daidola edese ameada, ami dolö Sisaïe mosö beaha neebe amoli sulubadelaeage, odoa nefolalebe amoli sulubadelaeage, helësësaleada, na Gelesoïe hamoi hamolasi amogi, ne nafodola galabaia negei neala helësësamelë. <verse eid="PHP 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14" />Amase, ne nafodola galabaia negei neebe weada, Dafidilo Geloia nedoo yafie nefolalebe amolile asigi gelolasisebegi, ilia bedäla made, ado mala gelola säla ïaha neamelë.<verse eid="PHP 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15" />Dofä, odoa nema mudialo amoliage, adoea gëgëlo amoliage, Gelesoïe ado mala amo säla olelesa nea. Gaso, odoaeada, asigi hedabi bëgëi nea, olelesa neamelë. <verse eid="PHP 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16" />Dolö hobeala säi amoliada, odoaea Ado Mala Hedabi amoïe mi nabasegi, na säla obëgëmäia, Godea ne memelela ifosi gabula helësëla, ilia boba hamolo ameada, amala hamosa nea. <verse eid="PHP 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17" />Amase, dafidi säi amoliada, hili ilimu helësëla, Gelesoïe ado mala säla olelelo nea. Ilile asigi hedabi amea made, ne nafodola galabaia negei neebewe yömäiaïe, amala hamosa neamelë. <verse eid="PHP 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18" />Amai gaso, gamelä. Ilile asigi dofä hedabi nea säi galëge, be, nafade musügä negela nea säi galëge, dofea, goda Gelesoïe ado malamu säla olelelo neagomelë. Amogi, na obeägïsa neawe. Amase, hobealage, obeägïsa namolömelë.<verse eid="PHP 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folo e aso, baagola made neada, Filibai udia dolö ugila negemolöla helësëi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19" />Na obeägïsa namolö amoïe mida, dilia Godema adosa aligise goeage, Yesu Gelesoïe Gesamia ne ugila negesa neebe ameage, na helësësaleada, Godea ne damula awäla fisigämolöla helësësamelë. <verse eid="PHP 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20" />Amaimo, nïe iso asigigila edefademalä sisiläfüla hamesebe amoda gowe. Nihïne hewamolöïe nelebo mogoi made afädë na made hamomolöila helësësamelë. Be, na helësësebe amoda gomalä. Walioge, hobealage, na bedäla made, gelola nea, mala hedabi na dafidi hamosa nelo amo gadola wäla, hamosamu namolöila helësësamelë. Ne baagosege, made baagosege, na nïe domalogi nelebo hamose amo sulubadela, Gelesoïe ëi gauia adogomolöïe, hamosa namolöla helësësamelë. <verse eid="PHP 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21" />Na nihïne helësësaleada, ne namolö mida, Geleso e neala helësësamelë. Amase, ne baagosege, nelebo hedabi amo baala nimolö gabula helësësa. <verse eid="PHP 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22" />Amai, ne nagadaiawi domalowe namolö nea galëda, na hamoi hamola gägä negemolö. Gaso, äudä amolegi, na abodowe memelemolödu, na dawa made. <verse eid="PHP 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23" />Äudä amolea ne dusugagisa neebe ameada, nïe iso asigigi yöi neawe. Ne namolö we fisila, Gelesobalä namolö moholöila hamesa. Amoda, hä, dofä hedabifalï hïdo elöi gabu. <verse eid="PHP 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24" />Gaso, ne made baagola nagadaiawi nea, dili ugila negesa namolö amoda, dofä edefademelë. <verse eid="PHP 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25" />Amo helësëlahilä, ne, aso, made baagomolö gabula asigisamelë. Amase, ne dili sulubadelabalä nea, dilia asigi afädë negei nebego bäumäiage, obeägïlo bäumäiage, baalasisa namolöla helësësamelë. <verse eid="PHP 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26" />Mida, ne dili neebea bu elö maaseda, dili Geleso Yesumadi nea, nema obeägïlahilä, ïe ëi gauia adogola dofä obeägïlo amo nobala adugamäiamelë.<verse eid="PHP 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Godea Filibai ili hedabolasila, ili së nase amo dofeala helësëi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27" />Amaimo, galone edefade dibe amoda gowe. Dili udia dolöbalä nea, ado säsebe amoge, mala hamosebe amoge, mogola nea, Gelesoïe ado mala dibe amo gadola, bëgëla hamosa namialo. Na dili neebe amo memele maasege, made maasege, nada dili aeala dila neala säse nabulömelë. Dilia gelolahilä, hamoi gowe gedola hamodila säla, udia dolö odoaea Ado Mala Hedabi nabala, asigi afädë negemäiaïe hamosa neëgi, <verse eid="PHP 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28" />dilile ado nii nefolalebe amolia dili yölasise amea, dili dofä fudugila, bedäla made neala helësëmolömelë. Dilia fudugila made bedäsebe amo ilia bealahilä, ili nufudadigimolöïe sigi moholö gabulage, dili damula moholö gabulage helësëmolömelë. Amoda, Godemadila moholömelë. <verse eid="PHP 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29" />Mida, Godea Gelesoma asigi afädë negemolö amomu dilima ï made. Dili Gelesoïe ëigi nea, së naha namolö amoge ïmelë. <verse eid="PHP 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30" />Na dafidi baagi sëi nea, nudusa nelo amoda, dilia melï amomelë. Amase, walioge baagi sëi nea, nudusa neebe amoda, dilia nabaha nebegomelë. Dilia amo gadola wäla baagi sëi nea, nudusa neagomelë.<verse eid="PHP 1:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2" />
  <para style="s">Nilïa nihïlïmu boba hamola nea, odoabalä hedabi hamomolö dialea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1" />Dilia Gelesobalä dila neebe ameada, dilile iso asigi gelolasilole. Boba hamolo ameada, dili neala aealasilole. Dilida, Eleloi Gesamibalä dila gedola afädëfalï aligilole. Dilia odoa bobasëla ugilada, negelole. <verse eid="PHP 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2" />Amalo galëda, nïe obeägïlo nobaha maademäia, dilile asigige dila, boba hamologige dilahilä, iso asigige, helësëloge, afädëdi namialo. <verse eid="PHP 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3" />Dilia nelebo afädë hamosalea, dihili dilimu helësëla, dihilile ëi gauia adala gugusäla bimäia hamola made, dihili dili nagadaialahilä, odoa ilia mala hamosebe ameada, nilïa mala hamolo amo baagi gabula helësëmalo. <verse eid="PHP 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4" />Dili hïdo hïdolaea, dihililemu made, udia dolö odoa nefolalebe amolilege helësëla sigi namialo.<verse eid="PHP 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gelesoea hï e nagadaiasebegi, Godea e gauia adogoi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5" />Diliage Geleso Yesuea helësëi amo gadola wäla helësëmalo.<verse eid="PHP 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6" />E Gode hï e wäla nea gaso, Godebalä afädëdi namolö wedala gaula fëdöla made nelo.<verse eid="PHP 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7" />Hï dafidi nelo amo giila negesa maadelahilä,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PHP 2:7">ea hamoi hamolasilo wäla hamola,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PHP 2:7">nilï neebewe neegela ägüi amo gadola, eege neegela ägüi ameada, dolöfä nelo.<verse eid="PHP 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8" />Udia dolö ilia beahaleada, e dofä dolöfä gabula helësëi nelo.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PHP 2:8">Amala nea, ea hï e nagadaiala,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PHP 2:8">ema säi amo gadola bëgëla awäha nea,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PHP 2:8">giso baagomolö asi.</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PHP 2:8">Dofä. Eda i fügäigi baagomolö asi!<verse eid="PHP 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9" />Amala hamoi ameada, Godea e neala gauia adogolahilä,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PHP 2:9">e ilibiafalï namiäia ifosi nea.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PHP 2:9">Ëi odoa dibe amoli sulubadela baagila asi dibe amo egali ï.<verse eid="PHP 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10" />Ëi amala ï ameada,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PHP 2:10">selesaia mosöage, nagadaiage, naga föi hawage, nelebo sege amoligi dibe neebe sebe amoli sulubadelaea</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PHP 2:10">Yesu ilibiala emo gumu sasagalahilä,<verse eid="PHP 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11" />ili sulubadelaea nafi dagala ulufadigila sähalea,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PHP 2:11">Yesu Geleso eda Dafidilo Geloi neala sämäiaïemelë.</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PHP 2:11">Amala sämolö ameada, ïe Eedo Gode hïdo elöi neala olemolömelë.<verse eid="PHP 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nilï udia dolö ili mogogi nea, yo digalo namolöla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12" />Amai ameada, ne damelë obeägïlola dili-e, ne dilibalä nelo amogi, na säse nabala bëgëi amo gadola, walio ne wagadi made neebewe gaaluge, dofä hedabola bëgëla hamosa nea, bedäla emo gigisëi nea, dili sigi obëgëi amoïe hamoi hamosa namialo. <verse eid="PHP 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13" />Mida, Gode hï obeägïla, hïle hamelo hedabi dibe amo gadola, dilia hamemäiage, hamomäiage, dilile isogi neada, hamoi hamolo nea.<verse eid="PHP 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14" />Dilia nelebo sulubadela hamosebego hamosaleada, habobala baagido säla, gëgësadialada, made hamomalo. <verse eid="PHP 2:14" /><verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15-16" />Dilia amala made hamoseda, dilida Godeïe malö nea, nafade afädëge, asiai afädëge maade, asigige gagadelai namolömelë. Namolöi namolöïe ado mala fëdöla gaula neebe amoda, udia dolö asigi halowei, nafade hamolo sosogo amoli mogogi ami nea, yo digalo mudaia gasumilï neebe amo gadoia, yo digaha namolömelë. Amala hamosa aligiseda, Gelesoïe segeyo besela galasolo amo gala, na helësësaleada, baluluia awäha nelo amo, memalä baluluia awäla waeasei made gabulage, hamoi hamosa nelo amo memalä hamola waeasei made gabulage helësëla, obeägïmolö dië bimolömelë.<verse eid="PHP 2:15-16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17" />Dilia Godema asigi afädë negei amoda, ema nelebo afädë odala ïlo amo gadola, ïe hamoi hamolasila ïaha neamelë. Amo gadola wäla, Godema ïahalea, wani ödä baala sögä salelo amo gadola, nïe heale baala sögämolö galëda, amoda dofea, na obeägïmolö. Dili sulubadelabaläge gedola obeägïmolömelë. <verse eid="PHP 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18" />Amo gadola wäla, dilia obeägïmolö dialea. Nebaläge obeägïmolö dialeamelë.<verse eid="PHP 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Foloea Dimodi e Filibai gaamugi mosäiala helësëi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19" />Amaimo, Dafidilo Geloi Yesuea Dimodi e dili neebea fisiga gamäia hamei galëda, na walio wegi wäla dili neebea fisiga gamolö helësësamelë. E asi obëgësalea, ea dilile ado säla ïaseda, nage nabala obeägïdelä. <verse eid="PHP 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20" />Nebalä nefolalebe weligida, Dimodi gadoida maademelë. Ea dili helësëla ugila negemolöïe, dofä idi hogosamu aligilomelë. <verse eid="PHP 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21" />Udia dolö sulubadelaea hili ilimu helësësalea, Yesu Gelesoïe helësëlo made nea. <verse eid="PHP 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22" />Gaso, mala hedabi Dimodia hamosa nelo amoda, dilia dawa. Malöea eedobalä hamoi hamolo amo gadola, ea ne ugila negela, halïgïla Ado Mala Hedabi amoïe, hamoi hamolasisa nelomelë. <verse eid="PHP 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23" />Amai ameada, ne galabaia neebewe, ilia abilia hamosebelela fädäla bealahilä, hobeala, na e dili neebea fodolofalï fisiga gamolö helësësamelë. <verse eid="PHP 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24" />Amase, Dafidilo Geloia idi oleseda, neege dofä dili neebea fodolo moholöla helësësamelë.<verse eid="PHP 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Foloea Ebafolodaidasa e Filibai mosalamolö helësëi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25" />Amai gaso, Ebafolodaidasa e dili neebea obëgëmäia, na e obëgëmalamolöi galeala dofä edefade helësësamelë. Eda nïe nedoo, nebalä hamoi gaalu hamosa aligiloge, halïgïla nudusa aligiloge nea. Amase, eda dilile ado gaula aulo nea, ne nelebo nimolö galeala, dilia ne helësëla, e mosaloi amea, ne ugila negeimelë. <verse eid="PHP 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26" />Obëgëmalai amoïe mida, ea dili helësëla, edefademalä bimolöila hamesa neebe ameamelë. Dilia e oloi dialeamelëla säi nabi amo, hï dawadigi ameada, ïe iso asigia yöia idogola, säosäosa neamelë. <verse eid="PHP 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27" />Dofä, dafidida e oloi edefade, baagomolöi dilo, gaso Godea e bobasësio. Emu bobasëi made, neege bobasësio. Mida, ea nïe iso asigia yöia idogola nea, yöia bu baaloeala helësësa neebe amea. <verse eid="PHP 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28" />Amaimo, dilia e bu beala obeägïmäiage, nïe yöi dibe amo hogosa helela usimäiage, na e dili neebea fisiga gamolö gelola helësësamelë. <verse eid="PHP 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29" />Ameada, Ebafolodaidasa e fisiga gasegoda, dilia obeägïlahilä, Dafidilo Geloiïe ëigi nea, e gauia wela namialo. Dolö egowe gadoida, edefade neala helësëmalo. <verse eid="PHP 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30" />Mida, e Gelesoïe hamoi hamosa nea, dofä baagoi gaso. Ea hïle namolö amo helësëla made, dilia ne ugila negemolö ulï amoda, ea ne ugila negela hamoi hamosamu nelomelë.<verse eid="PHP 2:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3" />
  <para style="s">Udia dolö Gelesoma asigi afädë negei nefolalebe amolida, dofä asigi mogoi nea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1" />Nïe nedoo nalifila dili-e, na ado säla wagahalea säsebe amoda gowe. Dili Dafidilo Geloima dila nea, obeägïsa namialola sähago. Dafidi säla ï amo gadola bu sämolöda, habosa made. Dili hedabola samiäia, bu sämolö amoda, dofea.<verse eid="PHP 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2" />Dolö odoa ügülo gadoi nefolalebe amoli, dilia hedabola idihë namialo. Hamoi hamolo gaso, nafade hamolo nefolalebe amoli, hedabola idihë namialo. Gafodo damula nafadelo nefolalebe amoli, hedabola idihë namialo.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amo gadoi beasebe fu amogida, dolö odoaea udia dolöma sähalea, ili Geleso sosogo nea, Isilaleïe mala bëgësaleada, gafodo damumalola sälo. Ilia amala säse amoda, Foloea hamei made nelo. Amalo ameada, ea Filibai ilia hedabola fädäla bimäiala ulufala säi.</char></note> <verse eid="PHP 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3" />Mida, gafodo damulo mala gaui fii dofäda, nilï neamelë. Ïe Gesamimadila nilïa Godeïe hamoi hamola, ïe ëi gauia adala, Geleso Yesuma dila nea, ema obeägïsa aligilo neamelë. Domalo daiagi hamolo mala dibe amogida, nilïa asigi dalagala galone gabula helësëlo mademelë.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Olomo 2.28-29gi dibe amo bimalo.</char></note> <verse eid="PHP 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4" />Amalo made gaso, domalo daia wea nelebo hamolo amogi, asigi dalagala galone gabula helësëse ameada, nihïne dofeala bealabio. Afädëa domalo daia weïe nelebo hamolo amogi, asigi dalagala galone gabula helësëse amoda, na baagila asi neawe. <verse eid="PHP 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5" />Nemea ne neegela ägüi segeyo gödögi, ilia nïe gafodo damui. Neda Isilale fii dolö neawe. Neda Bëyamini sosogo. Ne fiida, Hibulufalï nea. Mosesea Ado säla negei amo helësëla, neda Felesi dolö nelomelë. <verse eid="PHP 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6" />Godeïe hamoi gelola hamela hamolo amoïeda, na oböla, sesi udia dolö neebe amoli neala sëlasisa nelomelë. Ado säla negei amea hamomolöge, made hamomolöge dibe amo bëgëla hamosa maadela, mala mogoi hamolo neebe amoïeda, afädëa nafade afädëge, asiai afädëge nema sämolöida, maademelë. <verse eid="PHP 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7" />Amaimo, walio Geleso neala neada, na dafidi baala nimolö gabula helësësa aligilo amoda, oböla, aba adogola nelo gabula helësësamelë. <verse eid="PHP 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8" />Amomu made. Nïe Dafidilo Geloi Geleso Yesu e dawadigila namolö amo hedabi hïdo elöi dibe ameada, nelebo nagadaia dibe amo sulubadela aba adogola nelo gabula beagolesawe. Amai ameada, na Geleso e helësëla, na dafidi gaula nelo amoli sulubadela hä, fisisa maadeimelë. Amoli sulubadelada, galone iso gäwi made, gëgelë gadoi gabula helësësa neawe. Amoïe mida, na Geleso e fëdöla gaulahilä, <verse eid="PHP 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9" />ebalä dila namolöila helësësa neawe. Ado säla negei dibe amo na bëgëla hamosa nelo amea, neda asigi mogoi neala helësëla made, Gelesoma asigi afädë negei ameada, Godea neda asigi mogoi neala sämäia, helësësa neawe. Asigi mogoi neala sämolö amoda, Godemadila mulomelë. Amase, asigi afädë negei neebe amomamuda, amala sämolömelë. <verse eid="PHP 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10" />Na Geleso e dawadigimolöila hamesa. E bauiala nowela galala fedai geloi amo, na dawadigimolöila hamesa. Ea së mai amo gadolage, ne ebalä sosogo hamola, gedola nea, neege amo gadola wäla së molöila hamesa. E baagoi amoïege, neege e gadola wäla hamomolöila hamesamelë. <verse eid="PHP 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11" />Amala hamoseda, na helësësalea, udia dolö amoli baagoiala nowelasimolö amogi namolöla helësësa.<verse eid="PHP 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Foloea nofe dibea ami si gäwisi gelola baluluia asi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12" />Na walio säi amoda, na neaha maadeimelëlage, amase, neda hä, hedabi hïdo elöimelëlage, sähalea säi mademelë. Amala made hamoi gaso, Geleso Yesuea na bidi nimolö amo nimäia, ea ne ïe hamolasi neebewe nea, na bidi amo nimolöïe gelola balulusa neawe. <verse eid="PHP 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13" />Nïe nedoo nalifila dili-e, na niila made helësësa. Gaso, na afädë hamose amoda gowe. Nïe baagido dibe amoli elabolahilä, dibe siia bease amo nimolöïe, ami hedabola si gäwisi balulusamu nea, <verse eid="PHP 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14" />Geleso Yesuea hamoi amea, Godea ne fedamäia wei amoïe bidi amo nema ïmäia, wagamolö nofe dibea ami gelola balulusa neawe.<verse eid="PHP 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15" />Asigi fädäi nefolalebe nilïa amo gadola helësësa namolö dialea. Amo gadola made, dili odoaea elö helësësa nea galëda, amoge Godea dilima neala ulufamolömelë. <verse eid="PHP 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16" />Nilïa dafidi mala neala gaui amoda, fëdöla gaula nea, bëgësa namolöla.<verse eid="PHP 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17" />Nïe nedoo nalifila dili-e, na hamose amo gadola wäla, dilia gaalu bëgëla hamosa nea, ne gadoi mimisigili namialo. Nilïa hamosa nelo amo gadola, odoaea mala hamose amoli siia hedabola beaha namialo. <verse eid="PHP 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18" />Mida, na dilima dafidi säla ïahamu nelo amo gadola, walioda, hä, dïisa nea, bu säla ïahago. Yafiea mala hamosa neebe ameada, Gelesoïe i fügäibalä ado neaha nefolaleamelë. <verse eid="PHP 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19" />Amolida, heli sege nafadeia moholömelë. Domaloea hamelo amoda, ilile gode gadoi nea. Iliada, hewai mala dibe amo ilibiala obeägïla hamosa aligilo nea. Ilile asigiada, nagadaia nelebo dibe amolimu hehelësësa neamelë. <verse eid="PHP 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20" />Gaso nilïda, Hebeniïe udia dolö nefolalea. Amila damula aulo digamäia, nilïa dofä beaha nefolalea. Amoda, Dafidilo Geloi Yesu Geleso emelë. <verse eid="PHP 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21" />Eada, dibe neebe sebe amoli sulubadelaïe beaha aligilo geloi edefade ameada, nilïle domalo geloi made nefolalebeweda, ea hïle domalo hedabi hïdo elöi neebe amo gadoi namiäia, nilï neala domalo elölahilä, bedefala salugasimolömelë.<verse eid="PHP 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4" />
  <para style="s">Nilïa asigi afädëdi aligila, obeägïsamu nea, mala hedabi helësëmolö dialea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1" />Nïe nedoo nalifi obeägïlola dili-e, na säi amo gadola Dafidilo Geloima dilahilä, gelola namolöi namialo. Na dili boba hamolahilä, diligi edefademalä asigisa neamelë. Na bidi nimolöïe hamoi gelola hamosa nelo amoïe gägäda, dili neebe ameada, na dilima edefademalä obeägïsa neawe.<verse eid="PHP 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2" />Na ado afädë udia äudä Yuodia diage, Sïdege diage, alia ado gowe hedabola nabuäia hamesamelë. Ali Dafidilo Geloibalä dila nea, disama alida, dofä asigi afädëdi namialola sähago. <verse eid="PHP 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3" />Nebalä hamoi gaalu hamosa aligilo neebefalï-e, na dima sähago. Dia dofä udia äudä amole ugila negemalo. Ne elebalä nea, nilïa Ado Mala Hedabi amoïe hamoi hamosa nelomelë. Amase, Gelemëdi eage, dolö odoaeage, nihïlïgïla hamoi gaalu gedola hamosa nelomelë. Ilile ëida, namolöi namolö bebagi dëdëla negei dialeamelë.<verse eid="PHP 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4" />Dilia Dafidilo Geloima dila nea, segeyo sulubadelagi obeägïsamu namialo. Na bu elö sähago, obeägïsamu namialo. <verse eid="PHP 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5" />Dilia odoama aeala hame negelo mala hamolo amo udia dolö sulubadelaea bimäia, hamosa namialo. Dafidilo Geloida, hä, ga made neamelë. <verse eid="PHP 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6" />Dilia yöi dibe amo sulubadelagi säosäola helësëla made, nelebo sulubadela hamosebego hamosaleada, Godema adola digi, ëdëgëla digi, ema nesegesa nea, ea hamomäia, ema egedigila säla ïahamu namialo. <verse eid="PHP 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7" />Amala hamoseda, dilia Yesu Gelesoma dila neëgi, Godeïe dalulo amea dolöïe dawa sulubadela baagila aulo ameada, dilile iso asigige helësëloge sigi namolömelë.<verse eid="PHP 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8" />Na säla wagahalea afädë sähago. Nïe nedoo nalifila dili-e, mala gowe ili gadoi helësësa namialo. Dofä sämolöge, asigi mogoi namolöge, asigi falagasei namolöge, asigi gagadelai namolöge, aye negei dibe amoge, udia dolöea ilibialo amoge, sulubadela helësësa namialo. Amase, hedabi hïdo elöi diëge, hedabola hamoi gabula gauia adala sämolö diëge, amoli sulubadela helësësa namialo. <verse eid="PHP 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9" />Na ado dilima säla olelesa nelo amoge, dilia nabala gaula nelo amoge, na mala hamosa nelo amoge, dilia bealahilä, amo gadola wäla oodo bibila hamosa namialo. Amala hamoseda, neala aeala dalulasilo mi Gode neebe eda, dilibalä namolömelë.<verse eid="PHP 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dilia negali ï amogi nesegesamelëla säi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10" />Dilia siiba ne helësëla ugila negei amo gadola, walioge bu duulula besela galala, ne bu helësëla ugila negemolö dibe beagolei amogi, ne Dafidilo Geloimadi nea, edefademalä obeägïsa neawe. Dilia ne helësëi made made, ne helësësamu nelo gasoda, ugila negemolö amo fu made beala nelo gabula helësësa. <verse eid="PHP 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11" />Na oböla, ne nelebo maademelëla sähalea säha made. Nihï gaula neebewe gadoi gaula namolöda, dofea gabula helësësa. <verse eid="PHP 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12" />Amai ne nelebo maade aligisege, nelebo yafie gaui aligisege, na dawa. Na hamomolö afädë dibe beagolei amoda gowe. Ne molö yafie naha aligisege, ai, made naala, memalä aligisege, be, nelegei yafie galëge, maade galëge, nelebo amoli gadoi sulubadela nema besela galaseda, gamelä! Neda geleä aumala nea, obeägïsamu namolö neawe. Na hamomolö dibe beagolei amoda, egowemelë. <verse eid="PHP 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13" />Ne gelolasiloïe geloi ameada, na nelebo amoli sulubadela hamomolöi neawe.<verse eid="PHP 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14" />Amai gaso, dilia ne yöi gaula neebe amo beala, nebalä sosogo hamola namolö helësëla hamoi amoda, hedabola hamoi. <verse eid="PHP 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15" />Filibai udia dolö dihilige dawa. Ne Masedonia Bolobinisi baagila, Ado Mala Hedabi mi gäwila säsäla awäha nebegi, sesi odoa iliada nimäiage, ïmäiage, nebalä sosogo made hamoi. Diliamu amala hamosio. <verse eid="PHP 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16" />Ne Desalonaiga gaamugi nebegige, dilia ne nelebo nimäiala helësëla ugila negela ï amoda, afädë made, bu äudäla ïmelë. <verse eid="PHP 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17" />Nada dilile galu negali ïmäiaïe säha made. Dilia gägä negela, mala hedabi hamosebego, Godea baala, neala hedabomäia hamesamelë. <verse eid="PHP 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18" />Dilia negali nelebo ïasi amoïe sähago. Nelebo ï amolida, yafie, naabo habi amo gaula neawe. Dilia Ebafolodaidasama nelebo ïasi amoli sulubadela gaula maala negali ï amoda, yafie baagila awäla ï gabio. Galu ï amolida, nelebo gafisigäi Gode egali odala ïlo amo gadoi dialea. Godea dofea, mogola ïla helësëse ameada, e obeägïlasilomelë. <verse eid="PHP 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19" />Nïe Gode neebe amea, ïe nelebo yafie hedabi hïdo elöi Geleso Yesuma dibe amo gadola, nelebo ufoi amo sulubadela diligali ïmolömelë. <verse eid="PHP 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20" />Nilïle Naado Gode neebe amoïe ëi gauia adamolö amoda, diamolöi diamolö galea. Dofä amala hamomäiamelë.<verse eid="PHP 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Foloea Filibai udia dolö ili hawioi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21" />Godeïe udia dolö Yesu Gelesoma dila nefolalebe ili hïdo hïdolama hawioila säimelëla säla ïmalo. Nedoo nebalä nefolalebe we iliage, dili hawiola säsisebego. <verse eid="PHP 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22" />Amase, Godeïe udia dolö wi nefolalebe weli sulubadelaea, dili hawiola säsisebego. Sisaea mosöa nefolalebe amoliage, dili hawioila sämalola nema gelola säsisio.<verse eid="PHP 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23" />Dafidilo Geloi Yesu Gelesoïe ugila negelasilo dilile gesamibalä diamiäiamelë.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHP 4:23">Hä amo.<verse eid="PHP 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4" />
</usx>